# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit a real token.
#
# Used by scripts/live-check.mjs, and as the fallback when an environment's
# `apiToken` is not configured in Paperclip.
#
# Mint a token with the Sprites CLI:
#   sprite login          # prints a token on first authentication
#
# In production, prefer a Paperclip secret reference on the environment's
# `apiToken` field over a host-wide variable: the reference is scoped to one
# company and is never written to disk in plaintext.
SPRITES_TOKEN=
